# Pairs with ClaimsNeverConferTenantGroups. An asserted t/default/x survives an
# exact-shape test.
MODULE: ClaimFilterChecksGroupShape
TARGET: ClaimsNeverConferTenantGroups
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the claim filter strips only well-formed tenant group ids, not the whole t/ prefix
PERTURBS: ResolveClaims

--- FIND
        kept == {g \in asserted : ~(TenancyRegistered /\ IsTier(g)) \/ g \in dir}
--- REPLACE
        kept == {g \in asserted : ~(TenancyRegistered /\ g \in WellFormed) \/ g \in dir}
--- END
